dialect protocol
protocol semio.object.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio.object.diff
start body

# `DiffCodec::encode_diff`/`decode_diff` (this subset's own `🔺️diff/🦀️component.rs`) are the
# TEXT `print_diff` bytes verbatim (`self.print_diff().into_bytes()`), same simplification every
# hand-rolled `DiffCodec` in this program uses (`SvgDiff`/`GifDiff`/`JsonDiff`) -- there is no
# distinct binary framing to describe beyond the payload being opaque UTF-8 at this layer; its real
# grammar is `../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio`'s job.
framing record
chain payload utf8
